{
    "title": "RunYourPool",
    "description": "Discover the #1 Pool App Globally on the App Store!\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a tournament maker, pool commissioner, or just want to join a public bracket challenge, RunYourPool offers the ultimate platform for sports enthusiasts, allowing you to engage in thrilling tournament brackets. \r\n\r\nJoin millions of users and experience the excitement of friendly competition, all for FREE!\r\n\r\nYOUR ULTIMATE BRACKET APP\r\nWith 11 sports and an impressive, diverse selection of 42 game options, RunYourPool caters to every sports lover's passion. From the intensity of an NCAA bracket maker to the thrill of MLB or The Masters, there's something for everyone.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\nSelect your preferred sport, pick a game type, and invite friends to join the action. Make your predictions, engage in friendly banter, and keep the competitive spirit alive all season long!\r\n\r\nYOUR FAVORITE SPORTS\r\nNBA\r\nNCAA\r\nMLB\r\nNFL\r\nNCAAF\r\nPGA (including The Masters)\r\nNHL\r\nSoccer / Football\r\nAcademy Awards\r\nOlympics\r\n\r\nFREE PUBLIC CONTESTS\r\nNot in the mood to host your pool? Dive into any of our free public contests for a chance to win big!\r\n\r\nA COMMISSIONER\u2019S FAVORITE BRACKET APP\r\nAs a pool commissioner, customize your pool's settings to your liking, from scoring methods to participant invitations. RunYourPool puts you in control of your sports pool experience.\r\n\r\nLIVE UPDATES\r\nFollow your bracket picks in real-time with live scoring.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\nBracket Maker: Craft tournament brackets effortlessly and compete to see who reigns supreme.\r\n\r\nOffice Football Pool: Connect with your colleagues and bring some fun into the workplace with customizable office football pools.\r\n\r\nMLB Bracket: Dive into the excitement of the 2024 baseball season with dedicated MLB bracket features.\r\n\r\nTournament Maker: Create and manage tournaments for any sport with ease.\r\n\r\nCustomization: Tailor your pools to your preferences, and run the game the way it works best for you and your group.\r\n\r\nJoin the Community: Whether you're a seasoned sports aficionado or just dipping your toes into the world of sports pools, RunYourPool offers a user-friendly interface coupled with robust features to cater to your every need.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD RUNYOURPOOL\r\nJoin the millions of users who have made RunYourPool their go-to destination for sports entertainment and tournament brackets.\r\n\r\nDownload the app for FREE and embark on a journey of fun-filled competition.\r\n\r\nBecome a bracket maker today or join a public contest. \r\nDownload RunYourPool now!",
